    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Denise Paquette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104961850513022541223/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLUWjNcoAA4yaSaUqkKD1Dxb3ImpShAbGHP1-Mk1CoB63gT13A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I was very very disappointed by our experience.  We were looking to get a car for our youngest daughter and the sales rep Denis said you will have the best experience here as to compared to where we shopped previously.  How wrong he was, it left a very bad taste in our mouth, we were told that the car was checked and verified by \"the best mechanics\" and when we left the yard there were already problems, daughter drove off the lot on a Thursday at 5h30pm and I had to have the car towed back Friday morning as it died on my daughter as she was going to work at 6h00am.  She was quite upset as the car was declining in speed on the highway even though she was not trying to and then when she made it off   it died at a red light, we had to push it to a spot and the service I got on my first telephone call back to sales rep Alex, it was like I was disturbing him.  Needless to say I took car back, requested my money back and was told that they would cancel my daughters plate so she could get her money back, which by the way it took them nearly 3 weeks to cancel and my daughter ended up getting an invoice from the SAAQ for a renewal of her plate......not impressed at all and I could go on some more but I will definitely not recommend this place .",
        "time": 1508354903,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "xavier noronha",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114977345090441139232/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLXjU3KC75fTXgf7lWraLY8Pb62fFtDGuN6eVFT4ofwulWNxg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Rachel and Joey were great ,\nI got an older car and Joey was fully transparent about the problems the car had and has . the car had a few small problems He said he would try to get them fixed when i would pick up the car . guess what ...They actually did!  I fully expected them to say \" well we tried but unfortunately we could not\"  . This has never happend to me before. What a surprise!\nHowever ,\nthey tried to charge me a administrative fee.  According to consumer protection they are not allowed  to charge any fee except the sticker price and taxes on used cars. when i mentioned it they removed it with ought any questions,\nso buyer beware,\nOverall if u need a used car U should stop by here first.",
        "time": 1519069304,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Courtney Rodgers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116533487782784751059/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwH8G0968kGVQrV-qgDRtItYAik6OFI34czB0SuEpue8lzAbO-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I would not recommend anyone to purchase a car from this auto dealer. They are are already at 3.3 stars and their customer service is sketchy. Their sales person/manager was not nice on the telephone and was raising his voice even though the transaction was done. Hopefully someone else will have a better experience.",
        "time": 1614719801,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Am Na",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109876468248623989332/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCXc-Wzqke0GvghRKfHcpsYJQXnIM-ZC9WLQzvQDLn-0v7kLt3bQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Drove all the way out here to view a specific used car. Called to confirm the specs since it was a long drive for me. Upon arrival the car had much lower specs than advertised (no premium package). They claimed it was because the car was newly listed and they had used a generic listing. But it actually shows up as a Sponsored listing on CarGurus. Meanwhile every other dealer posts *no detailed info* when the car hasn't been processed yet. To me it seems like an unethical practice just to get people into the showroom to try to upsell a newer model. Totally wasted my time and made me lose faith in this dealer.",
        "time": 1583720307,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "sarah",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115808902557637224782/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURdnSYZd-HR1fXt-bkZjQqxpcwqd5VGzm6oJ7pIunc-qPOAjK7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Lloyd and Claude were very nice and understanding at Mazda! They weren't pushy at all which makes the process seem easier. Lloyd was also very personable and transparent about all the cars we looked at.",
        "time": 1551831207,
        "translated": false
